（教育部）留学服务中心的《国（境）外学历学位认证办法》第一条写明，认证是为了「满足申请人升学、就业、考试等需要」。第二条写明认证是「根据申请人的自主申请」做的。留服中心有一个认证院校查询入口，按学校名字查。它的使用须知写明，名单是近五年通过认证的申请里涉及的国外颁证院校，「仅供留学人员参考，不作…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：交学费之前先查学校在不在留服中心的认证院校名单里"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。在留服中心的「认证院校查询」里输一次学校名，几分钟就查完"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["中国（教育部）留学服务中心的《国（境）外学历学位认证办法》第一条写明，认证是为了「满足申请人升学、就业、考试等需要」。第二条写明认证是「根据申请人的自主申请」做的。留服中心有一个认证院校查询入口，按学校名字查。它的使用须知写明，名单是近五年通过认证的申请里涉及的国外颁证院校，「仅供留学人员参考，不作为任何通过认证的保证或依据」。须知还写明，受理范围「不限于本查询功能显示的院校」，每份申请都单独评估，学校合不合法、有没有发证资格只是考量之一。名单每年更新一次。2025 年那次更新移除了近 5 年没出过认证书的学校 270 所。另外，教育部教育涉外监管信息网还公布中外合作办学和境外办学的监管信息"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["中国（教育部）留学服务中心. 认证院校查询（含使用须知）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://yxcx.cscse.edu.cn/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://yxcx.cscse.edu.cn/"]},"；中国（教育部）留学服务中心 (2023). 国（境）外学历学位认证办法（第一、二条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://zwfw.cscse.edu.cn/zwfw/lxfwzxwsfwdt2020/xlxwrz32/409891/rzbf/2026042823373762003/index.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://zwfw.cscse.edu.cn/zwfw/lxfwzxwsfwdt2020/xlxwrz32/409891/rzbf/2026042823373762003/index.html"]},"；教育部教育涉外监管信息网. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://jsj.moe.gov.cn/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://jsj.moe.gov.cn/"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["中介嘴上说「教育部认可」不算数，以你自己上网查到的结果为准。名单会变，入学时在名单里，毕业时不一定还在，所以读书期间每年复查一次。中外合作办学的项目另有一套认证注册的制度。2008 年以后入学的，可以凭姓名和身份证号，在涉外监管信息网查自己的注册序号。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/32-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"盯住美国 F-1 新规的官司：「最长四年、读完 30 天内走」原定 2026 年 9 月 15 日生效，前一天被法院暂停，眼下仍是「读完为止」"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["打工时数是美加英澳四国都写死的红线，超一小时就是违反签证条件"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["四个国家都给学生签证的打工时间定了上限。超了就是违反签证条件。上课期间，美国每周 20 小时，英国读学位每周 20 小时、学位以下 10 小时。加拿大每周 24…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["身份的根是「全日制在读」：休学、退学、转学空档期一律不能打工"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["能不能打工，看你是不是正在全日制上学。一旦休学、退学、被开除，或者转学期间没在上课，打工资格当场就没了。这时候接着干，就是非法打工。签证没到期，不等于还能打工。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["美国：搬家后 10 天内必须报新地址"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["在美国换了住的地方，法律要求 10 天之内通知移民局。不报不是小事。一来它本身违法，二来移民局寄给你的信可能收不到。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["出发前和在读期间，看一眼教育部的留学预警"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["教育部会对某个国家或者地区专门发预警，说那里近期的治安或者政策对中国留学生不利。这是官方公开发布的风险提示，白纸黑字能查到，比中介的说法可靠。看一眼不花钱。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["澳大利亚：OSHC 必须覆盖全程且中间不能断，落地拿不出保险可能被拒绝入境"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["澳大利亚把留学生医疗保险写进了签证条件，不是可买可不买。保险要盖住整个停留期。续签换保单的时候，中间不能有空档。入境时拿不出保险证明，可能当场被拒绝入境。家里人…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/32-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["英国：签证费之外还有一笔按年收的医疗附加费，学生每年 776 英镑，申请时一次付清"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["去英国要交的钱不止签证费。还要按签证年数预交医疗附加费，交了才能用英国的国民医疗服务。两年的签证就是一次交 1552 英镑。再加上签证费，出发前这一笔要一次交清…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/32"},"children":["阅读整个主题：出国留学：身份、打工、保险和回国认证 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2